md(n,'Keeping the radio active is one of the biggest power costs on a phone. So the radio has states, controlled by **RRC** (Radio Resource Control):','Radio activity can contribute substantially to energy use, depending on the device and workload. **RRC** (Radio Resource Control) manages connection states:', 'Qualify energy claim; RRC connection states are not literal power levels.')
