md(n,'base stations buffer generously to avoid loss over the radio, so latency under load can climb to hundreds of ms (bufferbloat).','large persistent queues on a mobile path can add substantial latency under load (bufferbloat); measure the location and size rather than assuming a particular base station buffer.', 'Avoid unsupported universal deployment behaviour and numerical range.')
